+# Performance history
+
+## SessionStart health gate
+
+On a 5,000-record store, the measured SessionStart hook p50 was **11.9 ms**
+before `PRAGMA quick_check` was removed from the read path. After that change,
+made together with adding the trigger-maintained `fts_rows` counter and the body
+`CHECK` constraint, the measured p50 was **1.05 ms**.
+
+These are end-to-end measurements of the two configurations. Because the three
+changes landed together, the measurements do not attribute a separate latency
+effect to any one of them.
